        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>《腊八粥》课文批注页</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\nhtml, body {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  background: #ddd;\n}\nbody {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  align-items: flex-start;\n  font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK SC\", serif;\n}\n.page {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 540px;\n  height: 720px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(circle at 18% 46%, rgba(125,110,90,.035), transparent 20%),\n    linear-gradient(90deg, #fff 0%, #fdfdfb 47%, #fff 100%);\n  color: #242424;\n}\n.print {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 42px;\n  right: 20px;\n  top: 24px;\n  font-size: 16.5px;\n  line-height: 25.8px;\n  letter-spacing: .15px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n.print p {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n.fragment {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: -9px;\n  left: 84px;\n  width: 445px;\n  height: 31px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  font-size: 15px;\n  line-height: 24px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  transform: rotate(-.4deg);\n}\n.p9  { margin-top: 1px !important; }\n.p10 { margin-top: 0 !important; }\n.p11 { margin-top: 0 !important; }\n.p12 { margin-top: 0 !important; }\n.p13 { margin-top: 0 !important; }\n.p14 { margin-top: 0 !important; }\n.p15 { margin-top: 0 !important; }\n\n.right-continuation {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 302px;\n  top: 454px;\n  width: 220px;\n  z-index: 3;\n  font-size: 16.5px;\n  line-height: 26.2px;\n  letter-spacing: .1px;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n}\n\n.placeholder {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  width: 295px;\n  height: 250px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n  border: 0;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 55% 35%, #e5b4a0 0 8%, transparent 8.5%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 34%, #292622 0 16%, transparent 16.5%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 62% 65%, #315b8e 0 31%, transparent 31.5%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 35% 55%, #e1ad97 0 7%, transparent 7.5%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 33% 55%, #24211e 0 15%, transparent 15.5%),\n    radial-gradient(ellipse at 34% 75%, #79a7aa 0 25%, transparent 25.5%),\n    linear-gradient(145deg, #eef2e7 0 43%, #d3c39a 44% 65%, #95764b 66% 100%);\n  z-index: 2;\n}\n.placeholder::before {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 4px;\n  top: 31px;\n  width: 51px;\n  height: 68px;\n  opacity: .65;\n  background:\n    radial-gradient(circle at 12px 15px, #76756b 0 6px, transparent 7px),\n    radial-gradient(circle at 36px 27px, #899384 0 12px, transparent 13px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 7px, #8b8d82 8px 18px, transparent 19px);\n}\n.placeholder::after {\n  content: \"\";\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 0;\n  right: 0;\n  bottom: 0;\n  height: 43px;\n  background:\n    repeating-linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(76,51,28,.55) 0 2px, transparent 2px 24px),\n    linear-gradient(#b69159, #8a623c);\n}\n.placeholder figcaption {\n  position: absolute;\n  left: 7px;\n  bottom: 5px;\n  z-index: 4;\n  padding: 2px 4px;\n  color: rgba(30,30,30,.68);\n  background: rgba(255,255,255,.62);\n  font: 10px/1.2 Arial, sans-serif;\n}\n\n.hand {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 8;\n  color: #27221e;\n  font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", cursive;\n  font-size: 13px;\n  line-height: 1.05;\n  white-space: nowrap;\n  transform-origin: left center;\n}\n.red { color: #bf5d67; }\n.blue { color: #3f4b9c; }\n.black { color: #201a17; }\n.small { font-size: 11px; }\n.underline-red {\n  text-decoration-line: underline;\n  text-decoration-color: #b9515e;\n  text-decoration-thickness: 1.5px;\n  text-underline-offset: 3px;\n}\n.underline-black {\n  text-decoration-line: underline;\n  text-decoration-color: #26211e;\n  text-decoration-thickness: 1.2px;\n  text-underline-offset: 3px;\n}\n.mark {\n  position: absolute;\n  z-index: 7;\n  height: 0;\n  border-top: 1.5px solid;\n  transform-origin: left center;\n}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"fragment\">（7）儿很是[illegible]，只是想吃粥，可以看到八儿吃粥是[illegible]</div>\n\n  <section class=\"print\">\n    <p>饿，也<span class=\"underline-black\">不可靠</span>，不过因为一进灶房，就听到那锅中叹气又像是正在<br>\n    <span class=\"underline-red\">嘟囔的声音</span>，因好奇而急于想尝尝这奇怪的东西罢了。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"p9\">9、“妈，妈，等一下我要吃三碗！我们只准大哥吃一碗。大哥同<br>\n    爹都吃不得甜的，我们俩光吃甜的也行……妈，妈，你吃三碗我也<br>\n    吃三碗，大哥同爹只准各吃一碗。一共八碗，是吗？”</p>\n\n    <p class=\"p10\">10.“是啊！孥孥说得对。”</p>\n\n    <p class=\"p11\">11.“要不然我吃三碗半，你就吃两碗半……”</p>\n\n    <p class=\"p12\">12.“噗……”锅内又叹了声气。八儿回过头来，也不过是看到一<br>\n    股淡淡烟气往上一冲而已！</p>\n\n    <p class=\"p13\">13.锅中的一切，对八儿来说，只能猜想：栗子已稀烂到认不清楚<br>\n    了吧，饭豆会煮得浑身肿胀了吧，花生仁吃来总该是面面的了！枣<br>\n    子必大了三四倍——要是真的干红枣也有那么大，那就妙极了！糖<br>\n    若放多了，它会起锅巴……“妈，妈，你抱我起来看看吧！”于是<br>\n    妈妈就如八儿所求的把他抱了起来。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"p14\">14.“呃……”他惊异得喊起来了，锅中的一切已进了他的眼中。</p>\n\n    <p class=\"p15\">15.这不能不说是奇怪呀，栗子跌进锅里，不久就得粉碎，那是他</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <figure class=\"placeholder\">\n    <figcaption>[Illustration: mother holding a child beside a table]</figcaption>\n  </figure>\n\n  <section class=\"right-continuation\">\n    知道的。他曾见过跌进黄焖<br>\n    鸡锅子里的一群栗子，不<br>\n    久就融掉了。饭豆煮得肿<br>\n    胀，那也是往常熬粥时常见<br>\n    的事。花生仁脱了它的红外<br>\n    套，这是不消说的事。锅<br>\n    巴，正是围了锅边成一圈。<br>\n    <span class=\"blue\">总之</span>，一切都成了如他所猜<br>\n    的样子。\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"hand black\" style=\"left:83px;top:1px;transform:rotate(-5deg)\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"hand red small\" style=\"left:347px;top:47px;transform:rotate(5deg)\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"hand red\" style=\"left:204px;top:105px;transform:rotate(-3deg)\">语言描写</div>\n  <div class=\"hand black small\" style=\"left:150px;top:124px;transform:rotate(-2deg)\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"hand red\" style=\"left:198px;top:145px;transform:rotate(-4deg)\">语言描写</div>\n  <div class=\"hand black\" style=\"left:358px;top:161px;transform:rotate(-5deg)\">跟妈妈讨价还价，想多分些</div>\n  <div class=\"hand black small\" style=\"left:366px;top:180px;transform:rotate(3deg)\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"hand red small\" style=\"left:296px;top:203px;transform:rotate(-5deg)\">动作描写</div>\n  <div class=\"hand black small\" style=\"left:382px;top:216px;transform:rotate(2deg)\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"hand blue\" style=\"left:278px;top:321px;transform:rotate(-3deg)\">心理描写</div>\n  <div class=\"hand red\" style=\"left:258px;top:374px;transform:rotate(-4deg)\">动作描写</div>\n  <div class=\"hand black\" style=\"left:374px;top:381px;transform:rotate(-5deg)\">表现了他的好奇。</div>\n\n  <div class=\"hand black small\" style=\"left:430px;top:447px;transform:rotate(4deg)\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"hand black small\" style=\"left:278px;top:674px;transform:rotate(5deg)\">[illegible]</div>\n  <div class=\"hand black small\" style=\"left:307px;top:696px;transform:rotate(-4deg)\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"mark\" style=\"left:78px;top:37px;width:90px;color:#29221d;transform:rotate(-1deg)\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mark\" style=\"left:41px;top:67px;width:118px;color:#b9515e;transform:rotate(1deg)\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mark\" style=\"left:120px;top:125px;width:154px;color:#27211e;transform:rotate(-2deg)\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mark\" style=\"left:43px;top:159px;width:151px;color:#b9515e;transform:rotate(-1deg)\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mark\" style=\"left:41px;top:226px;width:227px;color:#27211e;transform:rotate(-1deg)\"></div>\n  <div class=\"mark\" style=\"left:217px;top:330px;width:98px;color:#3f4b9c;transform:rotate(2deg)\"></div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>",
